# 统一换行：源码一律 LF 入库并在检出时保持 LF。
# 否则 Windows 检出成 CRLF 后，`dart format --set-exit-if-changed` 会在本地与 CI 之间产生分歧。
* text=auto

*.dart text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.gradle text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.apk binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
